{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124522","id":4882800564,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIwmftA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124522","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124522.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124522.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124522","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124522/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124522/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124522/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5e3fd09e236efeab0109e798cef72e1ef97eefae","number":124522,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"web: Prevent audio from calling volume set on unchanged channels","user":{"login":"schme16","id":116081,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjA4MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116081?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/schme16","html_url":"https://github.com/schme16","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schme16/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schme16/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schme16/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schme16/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schme16/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schme16/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schme16/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schme16/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schme16/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"No AI was used to author this change\n\n\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\nPerformance testing was showing web audio using a surprising amount of CPU when it should have been doing very little work.\n\n## Additional information\nA:B / Split testing the web audio JavaScript glue file narrowed it to Godot setting the volume every frame, regardless of if that channel had changes. On desktop I would expect the cost to be nearly 0 (though to be honest, I never profiled it), but on web it was up to 0.2ms of extra overhead. I know that's pretty small, but on web every MS is precious!\n\nAdded a channel volume cache that does a lookup of if the given value is actually different, and updates the channel only when it is, and swapped to using  `subarray` over `slice` to cut down on possible GC thrash from creating/destroying arrays with new data.\n\n## Results: \nBefore: 0.14 - 0.2ms -> After: ~0.03ms\n\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":47013